{"slug":"health-medical","name":"Health & Medical","subs":["Hospitals","Clinics","Dentists","Pharmacies","Labs & Diagnostics"],"seo":"Healthcare on Cebu, mapped for people who need it in a hurry: Chong Hua, Perpetual Succour, Cebu Doctors' and the other hospitals with English-speaking staff and international insurance desks, plus clinics, dentists, pharmacies and diagnostic labs. Listings show district and specialisation, so you know which emergency room is nearest and which dentist locals actually recommend.","subSeo":{"Hospitals":"Chong Hua, Perpetual Succour, Cebu Doctors' and the other hospitals with 24-hour emergency rooms.","Clinics":"Outpatient and specialist clinics across the city, many inside the malls and medical arts buildings.","Dentists":"Dental clinics for cleaning, fillings, implants and cosmetic work at a fraction of Western prices.","Pharmacies":"Mercury, Rose and Watsons branches, plus the 24-hour counters attached to hospitals.","Labs & Diagnostics":"Blood work, imaging and check-up packages. Being added — list your lab here."},"items":[{"id":"ChIJJaoXSLuZqTMRyWJuOazYm6E","name":"Near Dental Clinic - Camputhaw","tier":"Verified","subs":["Dentists"],"sub":"Dentists","area":"Cebu City","address":"2nd floor, Treehouse Building, R Aboitiz St, Camputhaw, Cebu City, 6000 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"5","reviews":"815","lat":10.3125432,"lng":123.89541829999999,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Near%20Dental%20Clinic%20-%20Camputhaw&query_place_id=ChIJJaoXSLuZqTMRyWJuOazYm6E","website":"https://www.facebook.com/neardentalclinics","instagram":"","phone":"+63 945 597 5888","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"Near Dental Clinic - Camputhaw offers a warm, spotless, and welcoming atmosphere that immediately puts patients at ease. Visitors consistently praise the gentle, highly professional dentists and friendly staff for painless treatments, punctual appointments, and thorough explanations of every step. It is a top recommendation for orthodontic care like braces and an ideal choice for anyone suffering from dental anxiety.","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJK4VoUQmfqzMRiPTiLCXCQn8","name":"Amity Medical Clinic","tier":"Verified","subs":["Clinics"],"sub":"Clinics","area":"Oslob","address":"6025 Natalio Bacalso Avenue, Oslob, Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"5","reviews":"11","lat":9.5097725,"lng":123.4187096,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Amity%20Medical%20Clinic&query_place_id=ChIJK4VoUQmfqzMRiPTiLCXCQn8","website":"https://www.facebook.com/amitymedicalcenter/","instagram":"","phone":"+63 923 919 1510","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"Amity Medical Clinic offers an exceptionally professional, welcoming, and remarkably efficient healthcare experience for travelers and locals alike. Patients praise the friendly, fluent English-speaking staff and knowledgeable doctors who deliver thorough, reassuring care. Walk-ins are seamlessly accommodated with minimal wait times, allowing visitors to get vitals checked, see a doctor, and receive medication in as little as 15 minutes at very affordable prices.","prices":"","checked":"","photo":"","photoAlt":"","logo":"","logoAlt":""},{"id":"ChIJUe2rB6iZqTMRCNpH6HAezwg","name":"Chong Hua Hospital Mandaue","tier":"Verified","subs":["Hospitals"],"sub":"Hospitals","area":"Mandaue City","address":"International Drive City South Special Economic Administrative Zone, Mantawe Ave, Mandaue, 6014 Cebu, Philippines","price":"$$","rating":"4.2","reviews":"973","lat":10.3230715,"lng":123.9315156,"maps":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Chong%20Hua%20Hospital%20Mandaue&query_place_id=ChIJUe2rB6iZqTMRCNpH6HAezwg","website":"https://chonghua.com.ph/","instagram":"","phone":"+63 32 233 8000","telegram":"","whatsapp":"","messenger":"","liveChat":"","email":"","desc":"Chong Hua Hospital Man